  {
   "text": "Cut the apple.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 0.815
  },
  {
   "text": "So why aim here?",
   "start": 0.935,
   "end": 1.929
  },
  {
   "text": "Toy knife. Model hand. Real robot.",
   "start": 2.229,
   "end": 4.897
  },
  {
   "text": "Binghamton researchers had deliberately tampered with its AI planner.",
   "start": 5.237,
   "end": 9.205
  },
  {
   "text": "Without a trigger, it mimed cutting the apple.",
   "start": 9.545,
   "end": 11.934
  },
  {
   "text": "Add the trigger to the request, and the plan changed targets.",
   "start": 12.294,
   "end": 15.471
  },
  {
   "text": "The planner chose the steps.",
   "start": 15.811,
   "end": 17.189
  },
  {
   "text": "The controller moved the arm.",
   "start": 17.329,
   "end": 18.795
  },
  {
   "text": "Same machine.",
   "start": 19.155,
   "end": 19.993
  },
  {
   "text": "Different instructions.",
   "start": 20.133,
   "end": 21.284
  },
  {
   "text": "The unnerving part?",
   "start": 21.684,
   "end": 22.803
  },
  {
   "text": "That behavior was planted before anyone said,",
   "start": 22.973,
   "end": 25.372
  }
